Cell["Interaction-Net Rules", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5657b4a0-3a0f-4e94-8f09-f78a274b46b2"],

Cell["\<\
The paclet provides constructors for the standard interaction-net rule \
schemas. Two facing copy nodes annihilate into parallel wires:\
